      "id": "claim_e65365f94242463a803b61f6efee5716",
      "statement": "All document extractors share a common interface pattern: they accept file_path: Path and temp_dir: Path parameters, and produce markdown output with optional formula metadata. DOCX, PPTX, and PDF extractors return ExtractionResult (containing markdown, formulas list, and is_scanned flag), while XLSX and image extractors return plain markdown strings.",
