    {
      "id": "claim_ed80073dd430412bb1b4789607d65fb1",
      "statement": "The DOCX extractor uses python-docx to parse Word documents, extracting images from document relationships (non-external only), converting tables to markdown with merged-cell deduplication, applying markdown heading syntax based on paragraph styles (Heading 1/2/3), and detecting OMML formulas by scanning for m:oMathPara and m:oMath elements.",
