    {
      "id": "claim_b459d9e52f9648dd90810117dbead3e5",
      "statement": "The PPTX extractor uses python-pptx to process presentations slide-by-slide with recursive shape iteration for grouped shapes, extracts images from Picture shapes using content-type-based extension mapping (png/jpg/gif/bmp/tiff), converts tables to markdown, detects OMML formulas in text frame elements with slide number context, and appends speaker notes as blockquote text.",
