    {
      "id": "claim_a8994b73a15a43b486c3c18051d18da0",
      "statement": "The system distinguishes between display formulas (m:oMathPara element, entire paragraph/line is the formula) and inline formulas (bare m:oMath not inside oMathPara, embedded within text) for DOCX and PPTX. Each detected formula is serialized to XML and stored as a FormulaRef with is_inline flag and context text, producing <<FORMULA:N>> markers that are inserted into the markdown at appropriate positions based on formula type.",
